# Files owned by the user — fern generate will not overwrite these.
cli/hedra/custom.rs
README.md

# Workspace metadata (crate name/authors/version) + lockfile are hand-owned;
# the generator would reset them to fern-cli-sdk defaults.
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock

# Member crate manifests. All three crates are `dist-workspace.toml` members,
# so the release workflow (.github/workflows/version.yml) stamps one version
# across all of them; without these entries the next regeneration resets the
# two member versions and the workspace disagrees with itself again.
#
# Trade-off: a future generator that adds a dependency to the SDK runtime will
# no longer be able to add it here, and the generated code will fail to
# compile until someone adds it by hand. That is the loud failure mode, and
# it is the one we want — see ENG-10112.
hedra-sdk/Cargo.toml
hedra-types/Cargo.toml

# Release pipeline (cargo-dist) + CI + Dependabot are hand-maintained.
dist-workspace.toml
.github/
.fern/replay.lock
.fern/replay.yml
.gitattributes
